<title>FRANCE: Paris stocks jump to session highs on U.S. jobs.</title>
<headline>Paris stocks jump to session highs on U.S. jobs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares jumped on Friday afternoon after a May U.S. jobs report, dipped back then rebounded to session highs. Franc falls to lowest level vs dollar since April 1994 at 5.8745.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 index up 33.18, or 1.23 percent, at 2,724.03 at 1240 GMT</p>
<p>* CAC-40 Jun futures 2,706 vs 2,685 at Thursday's close.</p>
